  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Chef loves playing with strings. He has two strings `S` and `P`. Chef wants to insert string `P` into `S` at a given position `pos` (1 based indexing).\n\nYour task is to help Chef create the new string after the insertion.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input contains an integer `T`, the number of test cases.\nThe first line of each test case contains two space separated strings, `S` and `P`.\nThe second line contains an integer `pos`, denoting the position where string `P` is to be inserted.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, print the new string after inserting `P` into `S` at position `pos`.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1001 \\leq T \\leq 1001≤T≤100",
      "1≤∣S∣,∣P∣≤10001 \\leq |S|, |P| \\leq 10001≤∣S∣,∣P∣≤1000"
    ],
